@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3014

### Catálogo inicial: WIDGET tiene cuatro unidades; EMPTY tiene cero.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Some(product) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/WIDGET

### None -> 404 PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/MISSING

### Result.Ok: 2002 - 200 = 1802 céntimos; no reserva stock.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":2,"coupon":"SAVE10","note":"Recoger en almacén"}

### Some(0): descuento explícito del 0%.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":2,"coupon":"ZERO"}

### None: discountPercent y coupon son null en HTTP.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":2}

### Result.Err: 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":0}

### Result.Err: 400 INVALID_COUPON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":1,"coupon":"UNKNOWN"}

### Reserva confirmada: 201; quedan dos unidades.
# Repite esta petición: debe devolver la misma reserva sin consumir más stock.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":2,"coupon":"SAVE10","idempotencyKey":"order-demo-1"}

### Recuperar la reserva anterior.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/reservation-1

### Misma clave, contenido distinto: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"WIDGET","quantity":1,"idempotencyKey":"order-demo-1"}

### Un producto con stock cero existe: 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"EMPTY","quantity":1,"idempotencyKey":"empty-demo-1"}

### Política leída del asset copiado durante el build.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/policy

### Documento OpenAPI con esquemas explícitos.
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
